  "created": "2026-07-22T07:33:31.940Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A lot of worlds have been uploaded recently, often with AI thumbnails, that are uploads of purchased world prefabs with no modifications aside from all connections to the original creator being removed and often extra patreon etc. perks inside. This often breaks the creator's ToS!\n\nMy original suggestion and opinions on this are a bit more extreme, but I'd much rather visit the original world, so I think (at least) a checkbox on the SDK (possibly enforcable by reports/communicated DMCA intentions from the original creator) to input a link to the original world and display it on the world's page would show a lot more respect to world creators.\n\nI know I don't know everything, and that the system is complex, but I think something should be done to make this platform's world pages not look how they currently do.",
